<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon’s BIR rapid intervention force has broadened its deployment around Lake Chad while drones and joint border patrols continue in the Anglophone Northwest and Southwest, where separatists still attack government forces. Survivors of the 2016 Eseka rail disaster remain awaiting justice ten years after the crash, and a French court has authorized a third-party funder to enforce an ICC award against the state. The Supreme Court halted the appeal of a former minister sentenced for embezzlement, and a Cameroonian scholar has urged new peace talks with Anglophone separatists. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPLW93ZFRQNG1CektwTG1UVEVMdDRRbmRQNVUwWlQyUHFkVVpRVHhwZ19DQlZRZW1JT3dhbllFZi1fMXA5a1FxSVc0U25XOENXNy1KOUI2T05iWHBXY2V6MkFCWGVOaU5nT3I4eklpTVd5cXlyRGRUQ3BZQllzV01XZW1jRU5LWGtHUTgwd3Q4QTNVNVV4dEc2SGdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNd09IZHRpanAzWnhuc3pPZ0tSU2lPenJmdDhpZFVwbWxSZDNfaFlYdm41eEhNaDZibHVMY1FycTlJWEJGTVFNdS1oend6c1k2aDRoempfUmM0TldwcjJBbmpuWFlNZnFpYkhacjctLXVoaWFFdWxwcGJVOVBWYjQ2ZnlFYUNMX3l3MkpiV1o5UXNrUnJLOGN5V1FGekp6aFFFMkphUzJWS0pzUGxsb3V5VjNWN0dWN050LU0yQ1VoaU9jbDhaOVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQWEZ3NzRqV1FtVklLS1B6MGEyY2RVNEg2Z19kWjNVTTI1Q1gxS3NlNFZqeW4zSVJWTlZaVkFTb2NlZ2dzQVdqRVlDV1hZZXpwN1lhbi1zeklxUmZ0TTFEbnZWanA0bUlIZ1daZjZFc0VZcXNvYUdnZlRuWG40NU13WFBRRkxIZDRrTkVZWVFlUkZyZHlNT0ZGeTV1S2x3SndmN1J2Ry1jb2o5UlZ6MDgtNUJONA?oc=5&quot;&gt;MoreBranches&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https:/